text:
The ultimate battle of the bluffs is finally here! Iconic YouTube Creators @Chewkz and @SaeedTV_  are going head-to-head in the most chaotic Mystery Box Challenge ever attempted.

The rules are simple: Reach in, describe the object, and try to convince the other person you’re telling the truth. But when the objects range from cheese on a phone to Manchester United tears, things get weird fast. Every round brings more high-stakes bluffing and seriously questionable objects. Can Creators, in fact, lie?

Featuring: 
@Chewkz 
@SaeedTV_ 
@MaxMSelwood

Join us and our global guests to explore the history and future of Vocaloid culture, kicking off with Crypton Future Media CEO Hiroyuki Itoh discussing Miku's rise on YouTube and her evolution into a worldwide phenomenon. Alongside top Vocaloid producers @pinocchiop, @SAWTOWNE and @DECO27 sharing their personal journeys, we invite you to unravel the miracle of "Hatsune Miku"—a cultural movement built upon an endless chain of user-generated covers, dances, and fan art!

Tell us your favorite @HatsuneMiku moments in the comments! 

Special thanks to Crypton Future Media, Inc.

