@officialcharlixcx and Emerald Fennell are cracking open their YouTube Watch Histories and their viewing habits are as iconic as you’d expect. From Vivienne Westwood runway nostalgia, to BBC witchcraft documentaries, and the cinematic pieces that helped inspire Wuthering Heights, the pair reveal the videos that define their taste. 

