​@OliviaRodrigo is officially entering her new era with "you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love", so we “begged” her to give us the ultimate digital vibe check by breaking down her YouTube Watch History – and it exceeded all of our “expectations!” From 2010s core makeup tutorials with Bethany Mota to the One Direction fanfic that she herself wrote, this episode is a nostalgic fever dream for every Livie.

“The Cure” singer also spills the tea on her viral SNL double duty week and her thoughts on “Wuthering Heights.” Whether you’re hunting for album easter eggs or just want to see her geek out over miniature doll crafting, this deep dive is mandatory viewing before the new record drops on June 12. 🩷

