Friendships are put on hold, and the mind games have begun. @JadeBeason and @BellaHillVideos are trading their deep dives and aesthetic travel vlogs for a high-stakes seat at the Mystery Box Challenge. 

The premise is simple: Each round, they’ll reach into the box, feel a mystery object, and try to describe it well enough to fool the other person. Three rounds, one lesson in millennial, a handful of bizarre objects, and almost no trust by the end of it.

