Henry Van aka @officialcruxpuzzles cracks open his YouTube Watch History, and it’s just as delightfully nerdy as you’d hope. From 33,000-piece jigsaws to clever puzzles meant to stump your friends, Henry reacts to the weird, wonderful, and unexpected videos that fill his feed – all while solving 3 puzzles on the fly in less than a minute. 

He also shouts out a few go-to channels that help him out when even he’s stumped. Whether you're deep in the puzzle community or just love watching smart people figure things out, this one’s for you.

