Step into the world of Música Mexicana with @agushtopapa at the legendary @RanchoHumilde_ as they discuss iconic songs, memorable moments and specific details that have shaped this music genre and turned it into a global phenomenon. From legendary acts like @lostucanesdetj to modern superstars like @natanaelcano777 and @pesopluma_oficial; join Jason, Diego, and Angel as they uncover the rich history and cultural significance behind classic norteño, ranchera hits, and the rise of corridos tumbados. 

Whether you're a die-hard fan or new to Música Mexicana, this is an exciting look at how musicians and creators are revolutionizing this beloved genre and introducing it to new generations of listeners worldwide. 🎺🇲🇽

